  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "0.4.0 (v2, breaking): member injection is now member-anchored — [Inject] members generate Inject() on their own; [Injectable] attribute and Reinjectable are removed; IAutoInject is the class-level marker (derives from IInjectable). Memberless chain levels are transparent; injection is unconditionally idempotent with per-level all-or-nothing commit semantics; generated internals use the reserved Δ prefix. New errors DIG0018/DIG0019 flag hand-written IInjectable.Inject that is non-virtual or explicit on a non-sealed class (codefixes included).",
